title: Ayanokoji_Dialogue
---
<<declare $ayanokoji_DialoguePhase = "">>
//<<dialoguePhaseSetter Ayanokoji>>

//Declare Variables Here

<<if $ayanokoji_DialoguePhase == "QuestIntroduction">>
<<jump Ayanokoji_QuestIntroduction>>
<<elseif $ayanokoji_DialoguePhase == "QuestTaken">>
<<jump Ayanokoji_QuestTaken>>
<<elseif $ayanokoji_DialoguePhase == "QuestCompleted">>
<<jump Ayanokoji_QuestCompleted>>
<<elseif $ayanokoji_DialoguePhase == "QuestFumbled">>
<<jump Ayanokoji_QuestFumbled>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Ayanokoji_QuestIntroduction
---
You: Ayanokoji... What happened to you?? Why are you laying in bed?
Ayanokoji: *In Bed* Oh hey, it's you.
You: I asked you a question, are you going to answer?
Ayanokoji: Why I'm in bed, and stuck in bed for the foreseeable future should be of no concern to you.
    -> ...
        <<jump Ayanokoji_QuestIntroduction_02>>
    -> Um, okay. I see...
        <<jump Ayanokoji_QuestIntroduction_02>>
===

title: Ayanokoji_QuestIntroduction_02
---
Ayanokoji: However, as I am handicapped at the moment, there's something I will require some assistance on.
You: Oh, so you're saying you need my help. That's rare. So out with it. What is it?
Ayanokoji: Relax, always getting ahead of yourself. You're here anyways, so it would be a waste for this opportunity to be underutilized.
You: I think I'm about to develop a major headache-
Ayanokoji: Aurafarm.
You: What?
Ayanokoji: Aurafarm.
    -> And how should I do that???
        <<jump Ayanokoji_QuestIntroduction_04>>
    -> What.....
        <<jump Ayanokoji_QuestIntroduction_03>>
===

title: Ayanokoji_QuestIntroduction_03
---
You: What.....
Ayanokoji: You heard what I said.
You: Are you serious?
Ayanokoji: Do I look like I'm joking?
<<jump Ayanokoji_QuestIntroduction_04>>
===

title: Ayanokoji_QuestIntroduction_04
---
Ayanokoji: Don't overthink it. Be composed. Know when to speak and when to remain silent.
You: And if I refuse?
Ayanokoji: Then I'd have to reconsider how useful you are. After all, people are remarkably easy to influence when they believe they're acting of their own free will.
You: You really are something else.
Ayanokoji: Your opinion changes nothing. I have no particular interest in how you're going to accomplish it. Just don't make me regret asking.
<<dialoguePhaseGetter Ayanokoji "QuestTaken">>
===

title: Ayanokoji_QuestTaken
---
Ayanokoji: What are you still doing here? Go out and start aurafarming.
===

title: Ayanokoji_QuestCompleted
---
Ayanokoji: I knew my judgement was without flaw. A flawless victory.
You: Heh... Of course, that was a no brainer.
Ayanokoji: That aura... Its right there, your embodiment of it is overpowering yet healing.
Ayanokoji: *Ayanokoji stands up.*
Ayanokoji: Thank you.
*Ayanokoji disappears.*
===

title: Ayanokoji_QuestFumbled
---
Ayanokoji: Ah, you imbecile, I knew I shouldn't have trusted you with this assignment.
You: A-Ayanokoji, I'm sorry...
Ayanokoji: Look, if you didn't want to see me perish from this world, out with it, leave me be.
You: W-What?? You never mentioned how imperative this assignment would be.
Ayanokoji: I had no need to mention it, I had faith in you, but you failed me. *cough, cough cough*
Ayanokoji: Goodbye World.
*Ayanokoji disintegrates into a million particles. What a fail.*
===